  "title": "A knot builds exactly self-similar space of every dimension below two",
  "subject": "Which three-bit knots reproduce themselves exactly on every level-k Sierpinski gasket",
  "conclusion": "Signed not-all-equal, (-1)^a times the Legendre symbol of a+b+c mod 3, reproduces itself exactly on every level-k Sierpinski gasket, with a factor congruent to \u00b11 mod 3, because its two Eisenstein phase sectors stay locked along the gasket's edges. It therefore builds exact self-similar spaces of dimension log(k(k+1)/2)/log k for every k, approaching two, while shared subdivision of the plane admits no such knot.",
